id=netboost
name=NetBoost - Xiaomi 14 Kernel Network Accelerator
version=v1.1.0
versionCode=101
author=Te-River
description=Kernel-level network protocol optimization for Xiaomi 14 (SM8650, android14-6.1). BBRv3 congestion control + scenario-aware manager (boost/train/crowd/weak/wifi/game), MTU probing, keepalive and buffer tuning for CN mobile networks. Use SCENARIO=game for game login stalls on narrow-peering carriers.
